  "body_text": "开年后的一次机缘\n有容乃大的咖啡豆入驻了Camus\n通过Camus，我们接触认识了\nFaintStudio 《 凡提的介绍点击这里哦\n然后，通过有史以来最为顺畅愉快的一次沟通\n迅速的做成一单挂耳包定制\n// 接下来，我就要卖货了\nfaint本次是以“花”为主题，或回忆，或想象而创作出有温度的一些作品\n它们通过不同形式，画，杯垫，地毯，环保袋等等呈现给大家，期望每个走入Camus展览空间观赏的人们，视线所及之处都有阳光，有色彩。\n配合这次展览的三款咖啡产品\nEthiopia Guji Dimtu Natural - 热带水果，桃子，配合“红色”主题\nEthiopia Guji Kayon Mountain Washed 柠檬，红茶感；配合“绿色”主题\nFanti Bland 柑橘，桃子，蔓越莓；集合了上面两款咖啡的特征，再加入一款酵感突出的哥斯达黎加，要让你喝到春意盎然的赶脚\n喝不到，那就多喝几包，喝到为止 ～\n这一批定制的挂耳与faint工作室的精美作品都在Camus展览现场有售卖\n同时展览期间，还有两款主题特饮\nfaint in street\ncamus in street\n小游戏环节\n下面有两款特饮的配方表，猜猜两款特饮对饮歌分别哪个是A哪个是B\n图中已经有线索了哈\n有奖猜哦，猜对的话，现场购买任一特饮，可以抵扣5元\n有容乃大卖货小程序\n欢迎收藏",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          开年后的一次机缘\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有容乃大的咖啡豆入驻了Camus\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          通过Camus，我们接触认识了\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MjQ0MTExOQ==&amp;mid=2247483761&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=592604c6ae5fcd5b3a10adf087298feb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"FaintStudio 《 凡提的介绍点击这里哦\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           FaintStudio 《 凡提的介绍点击这里哦\n          </span>\n</a>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          然后，通过有史以来最为顺畅愉快的一次沟通\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          迅速的做成一单挂耳包定制\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          // 接下来，我就要卖货了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          faint本次是以“花”为主题，或回忆，或想象而创作出有温度的一些作品\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          它们通过不同形式，画，杯垫，地毯，环保袋等等呈现给大家，期望每个走入Camus展览空间观赏的人们，视线所及之处都有阳光，有色彩。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          配合这次展览的三款咖啡产品\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\">\n             Ethiopia Guji Dimtu Natural - 热带水果，桃子，配合“红色”主题\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"color: rgb(61, 167, 66);font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(61, 167, 66);\">\n             Ethiopia Guji Kayon Mountain Washed 柠檬，红茶感；配合“绿色”主题\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(61, 170, 214);\">\n            Fanti Bland 柑橘，桃子，蔓越莓；集合了上面两款咖啡的特征，再加入一款酵感突出的哥斯达黎加，要让你喝到春意盎然的赶脚\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n             喝不到，那就多喝几包，喝到为止 ～\n            </em>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rk7o5a8ZxgWASRwVLBsTbpR5jXub6pI5VGZ7Z4X9qvIaqFWJAqCOHB1yiam0gqxnkibekEiagvYUNpg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这一批定制的挂耳与faint工作室的精美作品都在Camus展览现场有售卖\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          同时展览期间，还有两款主题特饮\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            faint in street\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rk7o5a8ZxgWASRwVLBsTbpcwPSj48BogibTYiaa7tNLunuOQrpHiarJJw7PFfk6ZG7MDaO2OYCv5HuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;width: 540px;height: 519px;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            camus in street\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Rk7o5a8ZxgWASRwVLBsTbpqG70uYowuat1ykgnzt1KIKSY7tGPicBTriaKtJ2iaWkn1ib1dTFMPqhkTw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           小游戏环节\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</sectio